cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fr3-stack in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "fr3-stack: A low-latency, ROS-free control suite for the Franka Research 3"
abstract: >-
  A ROS-free Python client and real-time C++ daemon for the Franka Research 3,
  running Cartesian impedance, hybrid force/position, admittance and joint
  impedance control through libfranka at 1 kHz.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Jinzhou
  - family-names: Cheng
    given-names: Xianyi
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Robot-Dexterity-Lab/fr3_stack
url: https://robot-dexterity-lab.github.io/fr3_stack/
keywords:
  - franka
  - franka research 3
  - libfranka
  - impedance control
  - hybrid force control
  - admittance control
  - dexterous manipulation
  - real-time control
